			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Migrate remaining notification handlers to Batch 15 atoms\n\nReplace inline notification handler bodies in MountainVinegRPCService with delegations to the Batch 15 atom functions in `Vine::Server::Notification::*`. The migrated handlers include:\n- extensionHostMessage → ExtensionHostMessage\n- ExtensionActivated/ExtensionDeactivated → ExtensionActivated/ExtensionDeactivated\n- WebviewReady → WebviewReady\n- progress.start/report/end → ProgressStart/ProgressReport/ProgressEnd\n- languages.setDocumentLanguage → LanguagesSetDocumentLanguage\n- workspace.applyEdit → WorkspaceApplyEdit\n- window.showTextDocument → WindowShowTextDocument (new atom file)\n\nAlso removes the dead handler bodies at the bottom of the match arm that were unreachable after Rust selected the first matching arm for each wire name. This consolidates all notification dispatch to the atom layer, keeping MountainVinegRPCService thin with one-line delegations.",
			"SHA": "c834d103d4fc2f2002a1e55093df536bf58031c1"
		},
